    "infoLinks": [
      {
        "urlText": "Buses replace trains between Waterfall and Sutherland",
        "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-79394",
        "content": "<div><strong>Saturday 17 October</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>From 3am to 11.30am</strong>, buses replace trains between Waterfall and Sutherland.</li>\n<li>Trains run to a changed timetable between South Coast Line stations and Waterfall only. T4 Eastern Suburbs &amp; Illawarra Line trains run between Sutherland and Bondi Junction.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/trip-planner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Plan your trip</a> before you travel for up-to-date real time information. You can also subscribe to <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/travel-info/ways-to-get-around/train/about-trackwork#subscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">planned trackwork alerts</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Bus route</strong><br />10T4&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Waterfall, all stations to Sutherland and return</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Replacement buses</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Most replacement buses accept Opal. Tap on and off with a valid Opal or contactless card. Fines apply without a valid ticket.</li>\n<li>Bikes aren&rsquo;t allowed on replacement buses. Use a nearby bike shed or locker.</li>\n<li>Services may be delayed or cancelled due to driver shortages. We're working to minimise disruption and keep journeys safe.</li>\n</ul>",
        "subtitle": "Buses replace trains between Waterfall and Sutherland",
        "smsText": "Buses replace trains between Waterfall and Sutherland",
        "speechText": "Saturday 17 October\nFrom 3:00AM to 11:30AM, buses replace trains between Waterfall and Sutherland.\nTrains run to a changed timetable between South Coast Line stations and Waterfall only. T4 Eastern Suburbs & Illawarra Line trains run between Sutherland and Bondi Junction."
      }
